!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = K562 cells
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: K562
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: Human acute leukemia cell line
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: Control
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = nk-killing pressure: Lower
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = transfection: Cas9 and guide RNA library
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Genomic DNA was extracted using the QIAGEN Blood & Cell DNA mini kit (13323).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Library construction was carried out as described previously (Joung et al., Nat Protoc, 2017; PMID: 28333914).
!Sample_description = Amplified gRNA library from genomic DNA of transfected K562 cells.
!Sample_description = processed data file: LowSelection_Gene_Summary.txt
!Sample_data_processing = Library strategy: CRISPR-Screen
!Sample_data_processing = Adapter sequences were removed from raw sequencing read FASTQ files using cutadapt version 1.17 and options -e 0.1 -m 20 -l 20 (M. Marcel, EMBnet. Journal 17.1, 2011; DOI: 10.14806/ej.17.1.200).
!Sample_data_processing = Counts were made with MAGeCK version 0.5.7 based on the GeCKO sgRNA library via the "count" function with the follow options: --norm-method control --trim-5 0 (Li, Wei, et al., Genome Biology 15.12, 2014; DOI: 10.1186/s13059-014-0554-4).
!Sample_data_processing = Gene essentiality was calculated using the MAGeCK version 0.5.7 "mle" algorithm and the following options: --norm-method control --genes-var 0 --update-efficiency
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: hg19 (GRCh37)
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: *_Gene_Summary.txt: Gene summary text files processed using MAGeCK version 0.5.7. These files contain significance tests of gene essentiality (columns) for each gene (rows).
